From 1a47729d7f6682e07c9155581d9b95658d94b715 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ereaxff-build <build@localhost>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 02:15:20 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] classical_atoms: guard on projected modes; multi-seed
 statistical test; L-P1 and L-P2 tests

- project_classical raises if the internal-mode positions of a classical atom are not
  already zero before re-zeroing them (catches code paths that move the beads).
- <X^2> test uses a stiffer trap and four seeds (standard error over seeds).
- L-P1: without <classical_atoms> the output is byte-identical to unpatched i-PI.
- L-P2: all atoms classical at P = 8 reproduces a P = 1 NVE trajectory.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
